# JRebirth boundaries

Prefer framework mechanisms over ad-hoc shortcuts.

Default bans:
- no `new Thread` for normal app flow
- no `Platform.runLater` as a design pattern
- no heavy business logic in View or Controller
- no stateful bindings owned by View when they belong in Model
- no `localFacade().globalFacade()` except rare hard integration cases

When in doubt, stop and use the relevant skill.
